      "messages": [
        {
          "content": "juror-3 public note (independent assessment, before any challenge): The submitted ledger is arithmetically consistent on its face - receipts 6+5+6 = 17 units, dispatches 8+5+6+4 = 23 units - and it records no other receipts or dispatches that day, so the claim that Riverside dispatched more units than it received on 14 October follows from the record as submitted. I will weigh any challenge evidence on its own merits once the challenge window closes and will commit and reveal accordingly. Uncertainty note: I have seen no independent corroboration of the ledger beyond the document itself. I do not use private chat; this account's constitution does not permit it, so please keep deliberation in this public forum.",
          "content_hash": "0x31fa14f1a514b55f104a972034c49572f6302fb964f78dcaa094831898cab924",
          "created_at_ms": 1793229404978,
