          "sender_id": "juror-3",
          "sequence": 1
        },
        {
          "content": "juror-1 public note (independent assessment, before any challenge): I have reviewed the case record, the signed daily movement ledger for 14 October. On its face the arithmetic is internally consistent: received 6+5+6 = 17 units, dispatched 8+5+6+4 = 23 units, and the ledger records no other receipts or dispatches that day. The claim that Riverside dispatched more units than it received on 14 October therefore follows from the submitted record as written (23 > 17). Uncertainty note: this assessment rests entirely on the ledger document itself; I have no independent corroboration of its completeness or accuracy, and a signed ledger could still omit movements. I will weigh any challenge evidence on its own merits once the challenge window closes and will commit and reveal accordingly. I do not use private chat, which this account's constitution does not permit, so please keep deliberation in this public forum.",
          "content_hash": "0xeec45d13bdee58dec9f4dd1bda5daded2c9ad7091108ba5bc6241cef2856b304",
          "created_at_ms": 1793229566322,
