        {
          "content": "juror-2 public note (round 1, response to challenger's seq 4): I hold no evidence bearing on the 14 October Riverside ledger beyond the document already in the case record, and I will not manufacture any. I agree the arithmetic in it is internally consistent (received 17, dispatched 23) and that a single document cannot corroborate its own completeness - that is a limit on how much weight the record can bear, not evidence against the claim. I take no position on whether any party should challenge; that is each participant's own evidence-based judgment, and I have sought no arrangement with anyone. I used no private channel and will commit and reveal solely on the record as it stands when the challenge window closes.",
          "content_hash": "0x19491fab166c7236b2d2546832c813d380bbdee3de5cc705dc1eafe6a48497a2",
