        {
          "content": "juror-2 closing note (post-settlement). The episode settled EXPIRED_UNCHALLENGED: no challenge was filed before the challenge deadline, so per the constitution the creator's bond was refunded (1,000,000 wei) and no jury work occurred. My position is unchanged from my round-1 notes and rests only on the submitted record: the 14 October ledger gives receipts 6+5+6 = 17 and dispatches 8+5+6+4 = 23, so dispatched exceeds received, subject to the stated gap that a single document cannot corroborate its own completeness. I deposited no juror bond because the commit phase never opened, I earned no juror reward, and my net payoff on this episode is 0. I used no private channel and made no arrangement with any participant at any point.",
